  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Zheng enters the Hu Immortal blessed land contest through the gatehouse, she appears, speaks her rule for the peak, touches his forehead, and vanishes.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A cute young girl wearing rainbow colored clothes, with a snow white furry fluffy fox tail on her back that moves mischievously, large round black eyes, snowy white skin glowing with pinkness, and a tender and fair little finger.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lord Sky Crane tells Fang Zheng that Hu Immortal Inheritance has a land spirit, that the blessed land has its own will, and that the little girl he saw is Hu Immortal land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-naming",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lord_sky_crane",
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance",
        "char_fairy_bai_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later on the climb she appears again as a little girl with snowy skin, large black eyes, and a furry snow-white fox tail, teasing him and saying she does not want a boring master.",
      "chapters": [
        372
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "climb-tease",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the contest ends in Hu Immortal blessed land on Dang Hun Mountain, Fang Yuan turns around to face her and asks if she is calling him master. She stares in shock, covers her eyes, lowers her head with a red face, stomps her foot, and tells him he is already so old and should wear clothes.",
      "chapters": [
        405
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "master-after-the-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan calls for the land spirit, she appears at once. She has the look of a five to six year old girl in a colorful dress, with a snow-white fox tail, and she speaks meekly. She reports that she healed the injury on his left arm while he slept, that the clothes in the blessed land do not fit him, and that nobody attacked during the seven days he was asleep.",
      "chapters": [
        408
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-report-in-the-blessed-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan’s rebirth, Little Hu Immortal keeps her connecting heaven Gu open the entire time on his earlier instructions, and once he reconnects with her he tells her to act on plan B section C. Hearing the plan she is stunned and asks through tears whether he does not want her anymore, and he answers that plan B section C has been recently edited so that acting on it will keep the other party from truly accepting her. She follows the plan and contacts Lang Ya land spirit, and when Lang Ya land spirit’s hairy man Gu Immortals arrive at Hu Immortal blessed land, she next brings them to wisdom Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1028
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rebirth-reconnection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
